OL,3,GNEWSAWhat six grazing horses tell us
OL,4,Aabout England's housing crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout a five-minute walk from the train
OL,7,Fstation in Middlesbrough, six horses
OL,8,Fare grazing lazily on a derelict patch
OL,9,Fof land.
OL,11,FTethered and friendly, the animals do
OL,12,Fnot attract much attention from
OL,13,Fresidents, despite being so close to
OL,14,Fthe town centre.
OL,16,FBut their presence on the land, by the
OL,17,Fbanks of the River Tees, is a symbol of
OL,18,Fthe UK's decades-long failure to build
OL,19,Fenough houses.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
