OL,3,GNEWSAWhat six grazing horses tell us
OL,4,Aabout England's housing crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2004, the local council announced
OL,7,Fplans to build 2,400 homes on the grass
OL,8,Fthe horses are eating.
